Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.02,Default,Chapter,0,0,0,,{Intro}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.99,0:00:32.81,Default,Wilhelm,0,0,0,,Nunca vi você antes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.81,0:00:35.67,Default,Wilhelm,0,0,0,,O que uma mulher faz aqui fora tão cedo pela manhã?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.56,0:00:47.87,Default,Theresia,0,0,0,,Ah, não se preocupe com isso.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.87,0:00:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Só venha aqui.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.10,0:01:06.11,Default,Theresia,0,0,0,,Ei...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.44,0:01:12.63,Default,Theresia,0,0,0,,Você gosta de flores?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.39,0:01:24.10,Default,Crusch,0,0,0,,Tropas—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.10,0:01:25.82,Default,Subaru,0,0,0,,Manda ver nele!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.82,0:01:27.32,Default,Rem,0,0,0,,{\i1}Al Huma!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.53,0:01:46.61,Default,Crusch,0,0,0,,Tropas! Sigam aqueles dois tolos!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.32,0:02:02.90,Default,Rem,0,0,0,,Vão disparar o dissipador da noite.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.90,0:02:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Feche os olhos.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.11,0:02:15.40,Default,Subaru,0,0,0,,Uau...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.40,0:02:17.82,Default,Subaru,0,0,0,,É igualzinho ao que todo mundo disse! Incrível!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.97,0:03:03.28,Default,Subaru,0,0,0,,Aquela é... a Baleia Branca?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.95,0:03:11.00,Default,Chapter,0,0,0,,{OP}
